{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-07T08:59:59.177Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"54ac87379db6592d81af1cc6","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1665","claim:pm-gh1666","claim:pm-gh1667","lineage:pm-gh1667","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1665+pm-gh1666+pm-gh1667","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1665","claim:pm-gh1666","claim:pm-gh1667","lineage:pm-gh1667","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-bqyk1z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Public SDK class members and exported type declarations name 546 package types their entrypoint does not export, beyond the function signatures pm-gh1667 gated"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Found while fixing pm-gh1667 on 2026.11.7. The sdk-surface-snapshot generator now refuses an entrypoint whose exported function signatures name a package type the entrypoint does not export (signature_type_reachability), and the 281 function-signature gaps were closed. The same forgotten-export rule still fails on two wider scopes, measured on the emitted declarations: (1) public class members: 98 gaps, 83 distinct types, almost all PmClient methods exported from ./sdk/core (for example CommitItemMutationsOptions, ItemTransactionStatus, StatsResult, PmClientRunArgs), which ./sdk exports but ./sdk/core does not; (2) members of exported interfaces and type aliases: 875 gaps, 463 distinct types across every entrypoint (./sdk 185, ./sdk/runtime 243, ./sdk/core 133, ./sdk/testing 90). A consumer can call PmClient.commitItemMutations from ./sdk/core but cannot name its options type from that entrypoint. Extending the gate is the same analysis applied to class member signatures and to the transitive closure of exported declarations; the closure is large enough that it needs a deliberate per-entrypoint policy (re-export, or declare an entrypoint as a narrow view that points at ./sdk for named types) rather than a blind re-export. Duplicate check: searched forgotten export, unexported type, public type names, class members and PmClient types across all statuses; pm-obbh43 and pm-suhxny cover value exports only."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["api-surface","extensions","sdk","types"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-07T08:59:59.177Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-07T08:59:59.177Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The SDK surface gate checks public class member signatures and refuses a member that names an unexported package type, or records the entrypoint as a declared narrow view that names its canonical entrypoint; Every gap is closed or covered by a declared narrow-view policy, with the count recorded in the snapshot; A negative control that removes one class-member re-export fails the gate; A decision is recorded for the transitive type-declaration closure: gate it, or bound it with a measured ratchet"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-9rgaal"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"In a NodeNext strict consumer: import type { CommitItemMutationsOptions } from '@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/core' fails with TS2305, although PmClient from sdk/core takes it"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Types named by public class members are importable from the entrypoint that exports the class"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"98 class-member and 875 type-declaration references name types their entrypoint does not export"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.11.7"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"sdk"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-gh1667","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-07T08:59:59.177Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"01bb53c9b86d90da3baa3b6a95906841d716a7b7e4a896aa7a3fa5d6e4c284c6","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"f6bbd040b6ee87fc37c21fa5b1310fc2af7aab643df0f37148f4924d7b85b3a9"}
